## About Govern

The Govern function is new in CSF 2.0 and underpins the other five functions. It covers how the organisation directs cybersecurity work: risk strategy, roles and responsibilities, policies, and oversight of supplier risks.

## Key areas

- Establish and communicate a risk management strategy
- Assign roles and responsibilities in management
- Develop and maintain policies
- Integrate cybersecurity into supplier and ecosystem risks
